# CloudLinux

> CloudLinux provides stability, security, and performance tools for web hosting providers, agencies, developers, and website owners running shared, VPS, and dedicated Linux hosting environments.

CloudLinux helps hosting businesses isolate users, control server resources, improve website performance, reduce support overhead, and protect servers and hosted websites through products such as CloudLinux OS, AccelerateWP, MAx Cache, Imunify360, and related hosting-focused solutions.

